1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,140
You put AI in front of your customers.

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:05,920
Now anyone can type anything to it.

3
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:10,380
One clever message, and it leaks its
system prompt, runs up

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,100
your bill, or crashes.

5
00:00:14,630 --> 00:00:17,830
This is the Guardrailed Agentic AI API.

6
00:00:18,190 --> 00:00:23,090
A safe front door for your AI — attacks
stay out, secrets stay in.

7
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,740
Follow one question.

8
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:29,420
At the door, it gets a tracking number and
a key check.

9
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:33,950
Promise one: attacks stay out.

10
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:38,470
Every message is screened in code before
the AI ever sees it.

11
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:41,250
A blocked attack costs nothing.

12
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:46,090
A flood of requests gets a polite 'slow
down' — not a surprise bill.

13
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:51,030
Safe questions reach the AI, which only
makes the plan.

14
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:54,570
Code does the math. A hiccup? It retries.

15
00:00:57,970 --> 00:01:00,730
Promise two: secrets stay in.

16
00:01:00,750 --> 00:01:05,410
Every answer is screened on the way out,
before the user sees a word.

17
00:01:05,890 --> 00:01:08,790
Promise three: every change is proven.

18
00:01:09,190 --> 00:01:12,010
New prompts ship only if they score as
well on the same

19
00:01:12,030 --> 00:01:15,530
tests. This version got worse — blocked.

20
00:01:16,690 --> 00:01:20,110
Every decision lands on a tamper-evident
record.

21
00:01:20,510 --> 00:01:24,510
One tracking number ties each answer to
its trace and its logs.

22
00:01:25,410 --> 00:01:29,070
The AI plans. Code guards and enforces.

23
00:01:29,470 --> 00:01:31,070
People decide what ships.

24
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:36,600
Measured, not claimed: one hundred
seventy-nine tests,

25
00:01:36,620 --> 00:01:38,500
ninety-eight percent coverage —

26
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:40,580
no attack through, nothing leaked.

27
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:45,840
A real, running service — not a slide.

28
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:49,680
Your product. Your tools. Your rules.

29
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:51,800
The same safe core underneath.

30
00:01:52,290 --> 00:01:56,030
Designed, built, and measured by Kaarsten
Anderson.

31
00:01:56,790 --> 00:02:00,150
Let's build yours — kaarstenanderson.com
